.TH NEXUSOS-INSTALL 1 "November 2026" "NexusOS 0.2" "NexusOS"
.SH NAME
nexusos-install \- start the NexusOS installer from the live session
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nexusos-install
.RI [ calamares-options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Starts Calamares with the NexusOS settings as root (through sudo; the live account has
passwordless sudo). It refuses to run outside the live session (kernel parameter
\fBboot=casper\fR). Calamares writes only to the disk chosen on its partitioning page,
after the summary has been confirmed.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/calamares/settings.conf
module sequence
.TP
.I /etc/calamares/branding/nexusos/
NexusOS branding and slides
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR calamares (8)
.SH AUTHOR
NexusOS was crafted by Sanjay, with the NexusOS contributors.
